化；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;(f(0)=a\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)\\to f(n+1)))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;(f(0)=a\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)\\to f(n+1)))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>SNAt为指定起点的强正规化；SN为所有起点均强正规化。SN与Terminating等价由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e492786084299d72\" href=\"?note=e492786084299d72\" title=\"56-thm-termination-equivalence\">56-thm-termination-equivalence</a>显式记录，不以循环依赖定义。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","ancho